Privacy Policy for Shopplyn

Last updated: Octoper 5, 2026

At Shopplyn we respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal data we process,
At Shopplyn we provides the Shopplyn application as a commercial tool for authorized retail staff and partners. This Privacy Policy describes how information is collected, used, and protected.

1. Information We Collect
- Personal Information: When creating an account, we may collect your name, phone number, and email address for identification and authentication.
- Location Information: With your explicit permission, we collect approximate and precise location data while using the app to show you nearby stores, branches, and relevant local offers. We do not track your location in the background.
- Usage & Device Data: We collect standard technical information, including device identifiers and crash reports (via Sentry and Firebase), to diagnose performance issues and ensure app stability.
- Photos & Media: If you choose to upload a profile picture, we request access to your device camera or photo library. Photos are only used for profile personalization.

2. How We Use the Information
- To provide, operate, and maintain the Shopplyn platform.
- To track discount eligibility, transactions, and remaining credit limits.
- To send you push notifications regarding discounts, transaction confirmations, and account updates.
- To prevent fraudulent transactions and safeguard account security.


3. Data Protection & Sharing
We do not sell your personal data. We only share information with third-party service providers (such as cloud hosting, notification engines, and analytics tools) strictly to operate our services in compliance with strict confidentiality agreements.

4. Data Security

We take reasonable administrative, technical, and physical measures to protect your information. Communications between the App and our servers use HTTPS/TLS. However, no method of storage or transmission is 100% secure — use the App responsibly.

5. Your Rights

Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to:

Access personal data we hold about you.

Request correction of inaccurate data.

Request deletion of your account and associated data.

Object to or restrict processing (where applicable).
To exercise these rights, contact us at the support email/URL listed below.

6. Account & Data Deletion
You retain complete control over your data. You may delete your account and all associated personal data directly within the app by navigating to:
Profile > Delete Account.
Alternatively, you can request account deletion by emailing our support team at: info@shopplyn.com

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this policy. If we make material changes, we will post a prominent notice in the App or email affected users.

8. Contact Us

If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:

Email: info@shopplyn.com

Website: https://shopdashway.com/